{"id":"64779d4d642bf6b2","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-shepherdson-exact-separation.md","title":"Shepherdson’s Exact Separation Lemma","display":"lem-shepherdson-exact-separation — Shepherdson’s Exact Separation Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-shepherdson-exact-separation","aliases":["92-lem-shepherdson-exact-separation"],"display":"lem-shepherdson-exact-separation — Shepherdson’s Exact Separation Lemma","source":"第 VII 章 pp. 91–92，Lemma 2 与 Lemma 2*（PDF 108–109）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-local-binary-instance-code]]","[[92-df-effective-arithmetic-system]]","[[92-df-separation-in-system]]","[[92-df-consistent]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-shepherdson-exact-separation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-shepherdson-exact-separation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-shepherdson-exact-separation — Shepherdson’s Exact Separation Lemma"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VII 章 pp. 91–92，Lemma 2 与 Lemma 2*（PDF 108–109）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"31cbbeaa392f6458\" href=\"?note=31cbbeaa392f6458\" title=\"92-df-local-binary-instance-code\">92-df-local-binary-instance-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"323282b93f22ef06\" href=\"?note=323282b93f22ef06\" title=\"92-df-effective-arithmetic-system\">92-df-effective-arithmetic-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"905868da4e6087cf\" href=\"?note=905868da4e6087cf\" title=\"92-df-separation-in-system\">92-df-separation-in-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\cap B=\\emptyset\">\\(A\\cap B=\\emptyset\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\)</span>；\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h=\\ulcorner F\\urcorner\">\\(h=\\ulcorner F\\urcorner\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;v_0,\\bar h)\">\\(H=\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;v_0,\\bar h)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\in A\\lor\\Pi_G(y,x,y)\\in R_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\}\">\\(U=\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\in A\\lor\\Pi_G(y,x,y)\\in R_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\}\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\in B\\lor\\Pi_G(y,x,y)\\in P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\}\">\\(V=\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\in B\\lor\\Pi_G(y,x,y)\\in P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sep}^2_{\\mathcal S}(F;C,D)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sep}^2_{\\mathcal S}(F;C,D)\\)</span> 为二元普通分离：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的数码实例可证、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的实例否定可证；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}\\)</span> 为一元精确分离。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}shepherdson\\text{-}exact\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\n\\mathrm{Sep}^2_{\\mathcal S}(F;U\\setminus V,V\\setminus U)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}(H;A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}shepherdson\\text{-}exact\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\n\\mathrm{Sep}^2_{\\mathcal S}(F;U\\setminus V,V\\setminus U)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}(H;A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=(n\\in A),b=(n\\in B),p=(\\mathcal S\\vdash F(n,h)),q=(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg F(n,h))\">\\(a=(n\\in A),b=(n\\in B),p=(\\mathcal S\\vdash F(n,h)),q=(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg F(n,h))\\)</span>；实例记号在此由上游同时代入操作解释。分离给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[(a\\lor q)\\land\\neg(b\\lor p)]\\Rightarrow p\">\\([(a\\lor q)\\land\\neg(b\\lor p)]\\Rightarrow p\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[(b\\lor p)\\land\\neg(a\\lor q)]\\Rightarrow q\">\\([(b\\lor p)\\land\\neg(a\\lor q)]\\Rightarrow q\\)</span>，同时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg(a\\land b)\">\\(\\neg(a\\land b)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg(p\\land q)\">\\(\\neg(p\\land q)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 假；反设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg p\">\\(\\neg p\\)</span>，第一蕴涵给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\Rightarrow p\">\\(a\\Rightarrow p\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 假；反设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg a\">\\(\\neg a\\)</span>，第二蕴涵给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\Rightarrow a\">\\(p\\Rightarrow a\\)</span>。对称交换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,p)\">\\((a,p)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(b,q)\">\\((b,q)\\)</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\leftrightarrow q\">\\(b\\leftrightarrow q\\)</span>。因此正实例可证恰对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，负实例可证恰对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>；转到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 的一元实例仅用可证等价。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VII 章 pp. 91–92，Lemma 2 与 Lemma 2*（PDF 108–109）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-local-binary-instance-code","status":"resolved","id":"31cbbeaa392f6458","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-local-binary-instance-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-effective-arithmetic-system","status":"resolved","id":"323282b93f22ef06","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-effective-arithmetic-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-separation-in-system","status":"resolved","id":"905868da4e6087cf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-separation-in-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\cap B=\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"h=\\ulcorner F\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"H=\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;v_0,\\bar h)","display":false},{"tex":"U=\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\in A\\lor\\Pi_G(y,x,y)\\in R_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\in B\\lor\\Pi_G(y,x,y)\\in P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sep}^2_{\\mathcal S}(F;C,D)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}shepherdson\\text{-}exact\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\n\\mathrm{Sep}^2_{\\mathcal S}(F;U\\setminus V,V\\setminus U)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}(H;A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"a=(n\\in A),b=(n\\in B),p=(\\mathcal S\\vdash F(n,h)),q=(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg F(n,h))","display":false},{"tex":"[(a\\lor q)\\land\\neg(b\\lor p)]\\Rightarrow p","display":false},{"tex":"[(b\\lor p)\\land\\neg(a\\lor q)]\\Rightarrow q","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg(a\\land b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg(p\\land q)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"a\\Rightarrow p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg a","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"p\\Rightarrow a","display":false},{"tex":"(a,p)","display":false},{"tex":"(b,q)","display":false},{"tex":"b\\leftrightarrow q","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false}],"bytes":2223,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-shepherdson-exact-separation]] → [[92-thm-shepherdson-exact-separation]] → [[92-df-exact-rosser-system]]。普通相容性下的精确表示由该机制获得；不能把任意语义上定义同一个 c.e. 集的 $\\Sigma_1$ 公式替代进去。"},{"id":"faf6841087a5303b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-246","locations":["正文"],"count":1,